  "referenceNumber": "RUS1686",
  "remarks": "\n Major General Alexander Vladimirovich NOVIKOV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019. Major General NOVIKOV is a member of the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation, he has held the position of Head of the Department for Construction and Management of Unmanned Aerial Vehicles of the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation since 2013. Major General NOVIKOV is therefore an “involved person” per regulation 6(2)(a)(i) by “destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine” in that he works for the Government of Russia as a Major General of the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation, thereby fulfilling regulation 6(4A)(i).\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
